      "mergeID": "62e982ad81a7af44bdad3362",
      "mergedPostDetails": "i realize many people would prefer a way to categorize their avatar list but personally i see more benefit from being able to search my entire avatar list by name, (or even maybe a way to search with tags if they choose to add that)\n\ni know ive been going back to some of my avatar worlds to add more stuff and with the hundred extra avatars im planning to add its going to take ages to scroll back to my personal stuff, it was getting hard enough before and im shocked we havent gotten this feature yet.",
