      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "62e982ad81a7af44bdad3363",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It would be nice to be able to make use of that unused search box in the avatar menu to search through avatars I've personally uploaded, avatars I added to favorites or even VRChat's default avatars you can pick from by default. I have over 200+ avatars and it tends to get annoying if I'm wanting to use a specific avatar, I have to scroll through the whole list of avatars I've uploaded just to find one specific avatar I uploaded in the past.",
